INSERT INTO admin_idp.legal_document (id, doc_type, language, version, content, published_at, published_by)
SELECT gen_random_uuid()::text, 'TERMS', 'EN',
       COALESCE((SELECT max(version) FROM admin_idp.legal_document WHERE doc_type = 'TERMS' AND language = 'EN'), 0) + 1,
       $legal$Welcome to VYRA (Virtual Your Assets). These Terms & Conditions govern the use of the VYRA app and its supporting website. By registering or using VYRA, you confirm that you have read, understood and agreed to all of the terms below.

1. About the VYRA Service
VYRA is a free app for recording your personal finances (income, expenses, budgets and balances you enter yourself) and your wellbeing (mood and journal, habits and goals). VYRA is not a bank, e-wallet or payment service: it is not connected to your bank account, it does not hold or move real money, and every amount in it is only a record you entered yourself. Features marked "Coming soon" are not available yet.

2. Account and Registration
You must provide a correct name, email address and phone number that are still active. One email address and one phone number can only be used for one account. Your account becomes active once the OTP code we send to your email is verified.

3. Account Security, PIN and OTP
Your account is protected by a 6-digit PIN and OTP codes. Keep both confidential and never share them with anyone, including people who claim to be the VYRA team, because we never ask for them. Your account is locked for a while after several wrong PIN attempts. Change your PIN right away if you think someone else knows it.

4. Acceptable Use
Use VYRA only for lawful personal purposes. You must not try to access other people's accounts or data, disrupt or overload the system, misuse the Report a Problem feature, or enter unlawful content. We may suspend or close accounts that break these terms.

5. Your Data and Records
The data you record remains yours. You can download a copy through Profile → Export Data and delete your account through Profile → Delete Account. You are responsible for the accuracy of your finance and wellbeing records. Summaries, trends and insights in VYRA only reflect your own data and are not financial, psychological or medical advice.

6. Data Access by VYRA Administrators
By agreeing to these Terms, you understand that the VYRA Super Admin can access all data in your account, including transaction records and balances, mood check-ins and journal notes, habits and goals, for operations, support and security. Administrators with other roles only see the data their role needs and cannot see your finance records or wellbeing data. Details are in the Privacy Policy.

7. Service Availability and Limitation of Liability
VYRA is provided free of charge and as is. We work to keep the service secure and available, but it may be interrupted for maintenance or by events beyond our control. To the extent permitted by law, we are not liable for decisions you make based on your records in VYRA, or for losses caused by not keeping your PIN and OTP safe.

8. Intellectual Property
The VYRA name, logo, design and code are protected by intellectual property rights. You may not copy, modify or distribute them without our written permission.

9. Changes to These Terms and Contact
We may update these terms. The latest version is always available in the VYRA app and website, and important changes are announced in the app. By continuing to use VYRA after a change, you agree to the latest version. These terms are governed by the laws of the Republic of Indonesia. Questions can be sent to the email listed in Profile → Help.$legal$, now(), 'SYSTEM'
